201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (NutriPurna is a recipe generator that offers users a comprehensive culinary experience with features like nutrition tracking and meal planning tools. It provides refined search filters for recipes based on cuisine, meal type, cooking time, and calorie range. It includes a robust ingredient substitution tool to guide users in making healthy swaps. Additional features such as meal planning, nutrition tracking and a shopping list generator enhance meal preparation and dietary management. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
