205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In today's fast-paced world, maintaining a healthy diet can be a challenge. The increasing demand for convenient and personalized meal solutions has led to the development of numerous recipe apps. However, many lack the ability to integrate with nutrient tracking apps, leading to a fragmented user experience. NutriPurna is introduced as a comprehensive solution an AI-powered recipe generator that not only assists users in discovering recipes tailored to their preferences and health needs but also integrates with tools for nutrient tracking and meal planning)
/E (In today's fast-paced world, maintaining a healthy diet can be a challenge. The increasing demand for convenient and personalized meal solutions has led to the development of numerous recipe apps. However, many lack the ability to integrate with nutrient tracking apps, leading to a fragmented user experience. NutriPurna is introduced as a comprehensive solution an AI-powered recipe generator that not only assists users in discovering recipes tailored to their preferences and health needs but also integrates with tools for nutrient tracking and meal planning)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
