228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The paper leverages AI and machine learning to create an autonomous recipe generator specifically for Indian cuisine, using a dataset of approximately 6,000 traditional recipes. The data was cleaned and preprocessed to ensure quality, and the AutoChef model which employs Autochef algorithm, was developed to generate new recipes based on user-selected ingredients. The primary algorithm used is a genetic algorithm, inspired by natural selection, which helps create unique and tailored recipes by selecting the best combinations of ingredients and cooking instructions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
