234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The document evaluates AutoChef, which employs evolutionary algorithms and genetic programming to create valid and innovative recipes. It utilizes natural language processing to analyze existing recipes and generate new ones through a process involving data curation, ingredient detection, and recipe evolution. The system represents recipes as trees and explores new cooking methods by mutating these structures.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [19]
>>
