253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Artificial intelligence \(AI\) and image recognition technology have been applied to develop systems for nutrient intake assessment and food recognition. These systems use classification, food detection, and segmentation processes to analyze images and identify food items. They aim to provide reliable data for planning therapeutic menus and assessing the effects of meals on patients under medical care. AI-powered applications like Calorie Mama and GoCARB have also been developed to accurately identify food and calculate calories for dietary management. The use of AI in personalized nutrition and precision medicine is gaining importance.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
