/E (Recipe Recommendation Considering the Flavour of regional cuisine)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The document proposes a scoring method using cosine theorem for regional recipe recommendations that considers both the preferences of regional cuisines and the similarities between them. It quantify ingredient preferences of a regional cuisines by TF-IDF \(Term Frequency - Inverse Document Frequency\) and then score the dishes. It compose the score of the regional recipes and flavour similarity between regional cuisines into a recommendation using the Tidal-Trust algorithm)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
