267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Current recipe generators and nutrition tracking platforms typically offer basic features such as ingredient or cuisine-based search, nutritional information, and simple meal planning. However, they often lack advanced capabilities like dynamic nutrient tracking, intelligent ingredient substitution, and integration with personalized health data. Many rely on outdated databases and provide generic recommendations, with limited support for allergies, chronic conditions, or culturally relevant recipes. These gaps hinder their effectiveness in delivering a fully tailored and sustainable dietary experience.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
