<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In conclusion, through our study of existing research and analysis of similar problems in recipe generation and nutrition management, we have identified key areas for improvement and innovation. With NutriPurna, we aim to implement a comprehensive solution that combines personalized recipe discovery, advanced ingredient substitution, nutrition tracking, and meal planning tools.  Our approach is based on proven methods and is designed to offer an easy-to-use experience that caters to a wide range of dietary needs and preferences.This project reflect will our commitment to delivering a next-generation platform that enhances the way users manage their culinary and nutritional goals.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [0]
>>
